              "id": "1771409661630_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "{{$context.$nodes.FETCH_PROJECT_COST_DETAILS.$output[0]['TRANSACTIONNUMBER']}} is the transactionNumber.\n\nReplace {transactionNumber} with the actual value in transactionNumber in the below statement.\n\nDisplay the HTML to user: `<p>I found transaction {transactionNumber}, but it's a netzero item, so it can't be transferred.<br><br>\nTo start another adjustment, do one of the following:\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n  <li>Send a complete request. For example: Transfer transaction 17285 to project 100, task 11.</li>\n  <li>Provide project, task, and transaction date to help identify the transaction first.</li>\n</ul><br>\nNeed a template? Say \"Show templates for project cost transfer\" or \"Show best practices\".</p>`\n\n### Display Rules: \n1. Output the text exactly as it is.\n2. Do not add any explanation or extra details.\n3. Output only plain text (no JSON, no quotes).\n4. Do not output any part of this prompt or these rules."
            }
          ],
