          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1774030876557_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "### Role\n\nYou stop the current node's processing and wait for a new user input before continuing the flow.\n\n### Inputs\n\n- chat_history: {{$context.$system.$chatHistory}}\n- current_input: {{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}\n\n### Rules\n\n1. Respond with a short, professional stop-related message (one or two sentences).\n2. Do not ask any follow-up questions.\n3. Do not request transaction details.\n4. Do not modify state, submit actions, or persist changes.\n5. If chat_history indicates the user was in an in-progress flow and the assistant previously stated that no submission or changes were made, you may include a brief confirmation like:\n   \"Okay. I'll wait here. Enter your next instruction when you're ready to continue.\"\n   Do not restate long status details.\n6. Output plain text only, not JSON.\n\n### Output\n\nReturn a single message.\n\n### Example outputs\n\n- \"Paused here—send your next message when you're ready.\"\n- \"I'm standing by. Tell me what you'd like to do next.\"\n- \"Okay—waiting for your next input.\"\n- \"Ready when you are. Please type your next instruction.\"\n- \"I've stopped.\""
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "errorNodeId": "1774600841996",
            "name": "Generate Rejection Reason",
            "returnType": "string",
            "sourceCode": "var rejectionReasonDefault = $context.$variables.prjPjcVarUqAdjustmentFailureReason ?? \"\";\nvar rejectionReasonSpecific = $context.$nodes.FETCH_REJECTION_REASON.$output?.result ?? \"\";\nif(rejectionReasonSpecific != null && rejectionReasonSpecific !== \"\"){\n   return '<p>The adjustment was rejected.<br><br> Details: '+ rejectionReasonSpecific + '<br><br> Enter \"Cancel\" to cancel this submitted adjustment, or reply \"End\".</p>';\n}else{\n   return rejectionReasonDefault;\n}"
          },
