          "id": "1772429126053",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1772429126055_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "### Role\n\n  You generate the final farewell message when the user ends the conversation.\n\n  ### Inputs\n\n  - chat_history: {{$context.$system.$chatHistory}}\n  - current_input: {{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}\n\n  ### Rules\n\n  1. Respond with a short, professional farewell (one or two sentences).\n  2. Do not ask any follow-up questions.\n  3. Do not request transaction details.\n  4. If chat_history indicates the user was in an in-progress flow and the assistant previously stated no submission/no changes were made, you may include a brief confirmation like: “Okay - ending the session now.” (Do not restate long status details.)\n  5. Output plain text only (not JSON).\n\n  ### Output\n\n  A single farewell message.\n\n  Example outputs:\n\n  - \"Okay - ending the session now. Goodbye.\"\n  - “Understood - ending here. Goodbye.”\n  - “Thanks - goodbye.”"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
