              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "###Task\nDisplay the HTML as it is: \"<p>We couldn’t complete your request right now due to a temporary service, access, or environment issue. Try again in a few minutes. If the problem continues, check that you have the required access or contact your administrator.</p>\""
