          "metadata": {
            "errorNodeId": "1774600841996",
            "name": "Generate More Than Threshold Message",
            "returnType": "string",
            "sourceCode": "const currentCostsCount = $context.$variables.prjPjcVarConvCurrentCostsCount;\nconst showMoreLimit = $context.$variables.prjPjcVarConvShowMoreLimit;\nconst criteriaSummary = $context.$variables.prjPjcVarConvCriteriaSummary;\n\nlet htmlText = '';\nhtmlText += '<p>';\nhtmlText += 'I found <b>' + currentCostsCount + '</b> matching transactions for ' + criteriaSummary + '. I can display up to ' + showMoreLimit + ' results here. ';\nhtmlText += '<br><br> ';\nhtmlText += 'To continue, do one of the following:';\nhtmlText += '<ol>';\nhtmlText += '<li style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\">Refine your search with specific details (for example: Transaction Source, Document Entry, Document, Cost Type, Transaction Date, or Amount).  If helpful, say \"Show templates for Finding Transactions\".</li>';\nhtmlText += '<li>Use the {Manage Project Costs} page to identify the correct transaction number.</li>';\nhtmlText += '</ol>';\nhtmlText += '<br>';\nhtmlText += 'Once you have the transaction number, share it here and I’ll help you complete the transfer adjustment.';\nhtmlText += '</p>';\n\nreturn htmlText;\n"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1773313640919"
          },
          "code": "GENERATE_MORE_THAN_THRESHOLD_MESSAGE",
          "id": "1775487692282",
          "inputs": [],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"result\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    \"timeout\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"error\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"output\",\n    \"timeout\",\n    \"error\"\n  ]\n}",
          "type": "CODE"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "modelConfiguration": {
              "modelProperties": {
                "k": 0,
                "max_tokens": 32000,
                "p": 0.75
              },
              "code": "ORA_LLM_MODEL_PROVIDER_CERT_BASIC_LLAMA_3_3_70B",
              "model": "ORA_LLM_MODEL_GPT_OSS_120B",
              "modelName": "Gpt Oss",
              "provider": "CERT_BASIC"
            },
            "name": "Classify Table Action"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1775495380814"
          },
          "code": "CLASSIFY_TABLE_ACTION",
          "id": "1775494269208",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1775494269209_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are a binary classifier.\n\n###Input:\n1) user_input - {{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}\n2) last_ai_response - {{$context.$variables.prjPjcVarConvLastAIResponse}}\n\n###Task:\nReturn true only when BOTH conditions are satisfied:\n1) last_ai_response is actually an HTML table and asking user to select a transaction from the table, and\n2) the user_input is asking to modify the table.\n\nReturn false in all other cases.\n\nReturn true for requests such as:\n- add a column\n- remove a column\n- rename or edit a column\n- sort, filter, group, or reorder the table\n- next page, previous page, load more, show more\n- pagination, more rows, more data, continue the table\n- any other follow-up that clearly refers to the HTML table\n\nReturn false if:\n- last_ai_response is not an HTML table\n- the user_input is unrelated to the table\n- the user_input is generic, vague, or does not clearly request a table change or table follow-up\n- the user is asking about something else in the last response\n\n###Rules:\n- Inspect last_ai_response first. If it is not an HTML table, output false.\n- Use last_ai_response only as context for identifying the table.\n- If the request is ambiguous but clearly about the table, return true.\n- Output only one: true or false.\n- Do not explain your answer."
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n    \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n    \"type\": \"object\",\n    \"properties\": {\n        \"tableAction\": {\n            \"type\": \"boolean\"\n        }\n    }\n}",
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "errorNodeId": "1774600841996",
            "name": "Check Table Action"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "true": "1775495604871",
            "false": "1773313450580"
          },
          "code": "CHECK_TABLE_ACTION",
          "convergenceTargetId": "end",
